      "chapterVerse": "Verse 11",
      "sanskritText": "चतुर्भिः श्रीकण्ठैः शिवयुवतिभिः पञ्चभिरपि प्रभिन्नाभिः शम्भोनवभिरपि मूलप्रकृतिभिः। त्रयश्चत्वारिंशद्वसुदलकलास्रत्रिवलयत्रिरेखाभिः सार्धं तव चरणकोणः परिणताः॥",
      "translationEnglish": "With four Shiva triangles and five Shakti triangles distinct from the primeval nature of Shambhu, making nine primary triangles, giving rise to forty-three triangles along with eight lotus petals, sixteen lotus petals, three circles and three Bhupura lines, your abode expands.",
